WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:01.560
Your Highness

00:01.640 --> 00:02.480
General Zhu

00:02.600 --> 00:04.000
Has settled us all

00:04.520 --> 00:05.720
Some clans

00:05.800 --> 00:07.360
Unwilling to hand over command

00:07.440 --> 00:08.480
Those who stayed

00:08.560 --> 00:09.880
Are mostly veterans

00:09.960 --> 00:11.800
All fought over ten years ago

00:11.880 --> 00:13.547
In that defeat at Yong'an

00:14.320 --> 00:15.360
Back then

00:15.440 --> 00:16.840
We feared the Wuzhao

00:17.120 --> 00:18.520
And ran

00:19.400 --> 00:20.800
My wife

00:20.960 --> 00:22.040
And son

00:22.120 --> 00:24.480
All died under Wuzhao hooves

00:27.040 --> 00:28.440
This time

00:29.440 --> 00:31.440
We will definitely for Great Xuan

00:31.840 --> 00:33.400
Hold this city

00:42.320 --> 00:43.987
Then I'll trouble General Liu

01:55.040 --> 01:55.760
Liu Nian

01:55.840 --> 01:57.200
Pays respects to Your Highness

